,"role":"先使人通意于王","evidence":["wgc-q0526","wgc-q0090"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0037","role":"阴知其意、答谢使君","evidence":["wgc-q0526","wgc-q0090"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0526","wgc-q0090"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0526"},{"id":"wgc-e-9-e22","title":"令狐愚辟单固欲以为别驾","order":5457,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-9-e22","label":"裴注·魏略 · 正始中","text":"令狐愚辟单固欲以为别驾","evidence":["wgc-q0537","wgc-q0093"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0002","role":"与固父伯龙善、辟固欲以为别驾","evidence":["wgc-q0537","wgc-q0093"]},{"person":"wgc-p0058","role":"受辟拟任别驾","evidence":["wgc-q0537","wgc-q0093"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"正始中","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0537","wgc-q0093"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0537"}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0002","name":"令狐愚","evidence":["wgc-q0006","wgc-q0089","wgc-q0007","wgc-q0010","wgc-q0090","wgc-q0093","rensu-q-290cba5d2b68d0f51b6b","rensu-q-80ff7daee8ad71cdbf32","rensu-q-b9ac1e759b4e03807094","rensu-q-c9ec8d7dad0d8fc74924","wuwen-q-a147a548bdce7e6382d2"],"aliases":[{"text":"令狐浚","evidence":["wgc-q0090"]}],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wgc-m-o007-wgc-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及令狐愚","evidence":["wgc-q0006"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p002-wgc-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及令狐愚","evidence":["wgc-q0089"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o008-wgc-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及令狐愚","evidence":["wgc-q0007"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o011-wgc-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及令狐愚","evidence":["wgc-q0010"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p003-wgc-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及令狐愚","evidence":["wgc-q0090"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p006-wgc-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及令狐愚","evidence":["wgc-q0093"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-290cba5d2b68d0f51b6b","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"始，邵族子愚，为白衣时，常有高志。众人谓愚必荣令狐氏，而邵独以为：‘愚性倜傥，不修德而愿大，必灭我宗！’愚闻邵言，其心不平","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":240,"end":301,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-80ff7daee8ad71cdbf32","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"及邵为虎贲郎将，而愚仕进已多所更历，所在有名称。愚见邵，因从容言次，微激之曰：‘先时闻大人谓愚为不继，愚今竟云何邪？’邵熟视，而不答也","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":302,"end":369,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-b9ac1e759b4e03807094","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"然私谓其妻子曰：‘公治性度犹如故也！以吾观之，终当败灭。但不知我久当坐之不邪？将逮汝曹耳","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":370,"end":414,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-c9ec8d7dad0d8fc74924","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"邵没之后，十余年间，愚为兖州刺史，果与王凌谋废立，家属诛灭","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":416,"end":445,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-eb47a8df9a68937ff9c4","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"邵子华，时为弘农郡丞，以属疏，得不坐","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":446,"end":464,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o049c-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4379f656c1344049e595","layer":"original","quote":"四月，甲申〖5〗，以征南将军王昶为征南大将军。壬辰〖6〗，大赦。丙午〖7〗，闻太尉王凌谋废帝，立楚王彪〖8〗；太傅司马宣王东征凌。五月，甲寅〖9〗，凌自杀。六月，彪赐死。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":207,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：嘉平三年（公元 251）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-563b7a630850bbcc0541","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o048","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0006","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"是时，凌外甥令狐愚以才能为兖州刺史，屯平阿〖3〗。舅甥并典兵，专淮南之重。凌就迁为司空〖4〗。司马宣王既诛曹爽，进凌为太尉，假节、钺。凌、愚密协计，谓齐王不任天位〖5〗，楚王彪长而才〖6〗，欲迎立彪都许昌。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0007","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ddf21975cc3880c084aa","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年九月，愚遣将张式至白马〖7〗，与彪相问往来。凌又遣舍人劳精诣洛阳，语子广。广言：“废立大事，勿为祸先〖8〗！”﹝一﹞其十一月，愚复遣式诣彪，未还，会愚病死。﹝二﹞二年〖9〗，荧惑守南斗〖10〗，凌谓：“斗中有星，当有暴贵者。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0008","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-47cde046d1bd69dbed3b","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖11〗，吴贼塞涂水〖12〗。凌欲因此发，大严诸军；表求讨贼，诏报不听〖13〗。凌阴谋滋甚〖14〗，遣将军杨弘，为废立事告兖州刺史黄华；华、弘连名，以白太傅司马宣王。宣王将中军，乘水道讨凌，先下赦赦凌罪；又将尚书广东〖15〗，使为书喻凌。大军掩至百尺〖16〗，逼凌。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0010","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c5b208d206b4f5dd30b6","layer":"original","quote":"宣王遂至寿春，张式等皆自首，乃穷治其事。彪赐死〖19〗，诸相连者悉夷三族〖20〗。﹝五﹞朝议咸以为：“《春秋》之义，齐崔杼、郑归生皆加追戮〖21〗，陈尸斲棺〖22〗，载在方策〖23〗。凌、愚罪，宜如旧典。”乃发凌、愚冢，剖棺，暴尸于所近市三日；烧其印绶、朝服，亲土埋之〖24〗。﹝六﹞进弘、华爵为乡侯。广有志尚学行，死时年四十余。﹝七﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0023","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-60f24ec82e3162ca0f99","layer":"original","quote":"出为扬州刺史，加昭武将军〖5〗。王凌之阴谋也〖6〗，太傅司马宣王潜军东伐〖7〗；以诞为镇东将军、假节，都督扬州诸军事，封山阳亭侯。诸葛恪兴东关〖8〗，遣诞督诸军讨之；与战，不利。还，徙为镇南将军。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0089","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-38d197ffbf2f29a2df5f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“凌、愚谋，以帝幼，制于强臣，不堪为主；楚王彪长而才，欲迎立之，以兴曹氏。凌使人告广，广曰：‘凡举大事，应本人情。今曹爽以矫奢失民；何平叔虚而不治；丁、毕、桓、邓，虽并有宿望，皆专竞于世。加变易朝典，政令数改；所存虽高，而事不下接；民习于旧，众莫之从。故虽势倾四海，声震天下，同日斩戮，名士减半；而百姓安之，莫或之哀：失民故也。今懿情虽难量，事未有逆；而擢用贤能，广树胜己；修先朝之政令，副众心之所求。爽之所以为恶者，彼莫不必改；夙夜匪懈，以恤民为先；父子兄弟，并握兵要：未易亡也！’凌不从。”臣松之以为：如此言之类，皆前史所不载，而犹出习氏；且制言法体不似于昔：疑悉凿齿所自造者也。","attribution":"汉晋春秋；裴松之按","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bbdf8c981acf9fda8742","start":0,"end":303,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0090","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-16101e80dd1e52b3a276","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“愚字公治。本名浚。黄初中，为和戎护军。乌丸校尉田豫讨胡有功，小违节度，愚以法绳之。帝怒，械系愚，免官治罪，诏曰：‘浚何愚！’遂以名之。正始中，为曹爽长史，后出为兖州刺史。”《魏略》曰：“愚闻楚王彪有智勇。初，东郡有讹言云：‘白马河出妖马，夜过官牧边鸣呼，众马皆应。明日见其迹，大如斛，行数里，还入河中。’又有谣言：‘白马素羁西南驰，其谁乘者朱虎骑。’楚王小字‘朱虎’，故愚与王凌阴谋立楚王。乃先使人通意于王，言‘使君谢王，天下事不可知，愿王自爱’！彪亦阴知其意，答言‘谢使君，知厚意也’。”","attribution":"魏书；魏略","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-81528d5bf8ffad6565b9","start":0,"end":255,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0093","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-253ca430fef5076b7072","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《魏略》载：“山阳单固，字恭夏。为人有器实。正始中，兖州刺史令狐愚与固父伯龙善，辟固，欲以为别驾。固不乐为州吏，辞以疾。愚礼意愈厚，固不欲应。固母夏侯氏谓固曰：‘使君与汝父久善，故命汝不止；汝亦故当仕进，自可往耳。’固不获已，遂往；与兼治中从事杨康并为愚腹心。后愚与王凌通谋，康、固皆知其计。会愚病，康应司徒召诣洛阳，固亦以疾解禄。康在京师露其事，太傅乃东取王凌。到寿春，固见太傅，太傅问曰：‘卿知其事为邪？’固对‘不知’。太傅曰：‘且置近事。问卿，令狐反乎？’固又曰‘无’。而杨康白，事事与固连。遂收捕固及家属，皆系廷尉；考实数十，固故云‘无有’。太傅录杨康，与固对相诘。固辞穷，乃骂康曰：‘老庸既负使君，又灭我族，顾汝当活邪！’辞定，事上，须报。廷尉以旧皆听得与其母、妻、子相见。固见其母，不仰视。其母知其惭也，字谓之曰：‘恭夏！汝本自不欲应州郡也，我强故耳。汝为人吏，自当尔耳。此自门户衰，我无恨也。汝本意与我语。’固终不仰，又不语，以至于死。初，杨康自以白其事，冀得封拜；后以辞颇参错，亦并斩。临刑，俱出狱，固又骂康曰：‘老奴，汝死自分耳！若令死者有知，汝何面目以行地下也。’”","attribution":"魏略","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4f91883d6d27c782cd9b","start":0,"end":496,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0162","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"凌外甥令狐愚以才能为兖州刺史，屯平阿","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0166","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"凌、愚密协计，谓齐王不任天位〖5〗，楚王彪长而才〖6〗，欲迎立彪都许昌","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":67,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0167","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ddf21975cc3880c084aa","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年九月，愚遣将张式至白马〖7〗，与彪相问往来","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0169","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ddf21975cc3880c084aa","layer":"original","quote":"其十一月，愚复遣式诣彪","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0170","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ddf21975cc3880c084aa","layer":"original","quote":"未还，会愚病死","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0176","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-47cde046d1bd69dbed3b","layer":"original","quote":"宣王将中军，乘水道讨凌，先下赦赦凌罪；又将尚书广东〖15〗，使为书喻凌。大军掩至百尺〖16〗，逼凌","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0182","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c5b208d206b4f5dd30b6","layer":"original","quote":"乃发凌、愚冢，剖棺，暴尸于所近市三日；烧其印绶、朝服，亲土埋之","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":103,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0253","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-60f24ec82e3162ca0f99","layer":"original","quote":"王凌之阴谋也〖6〗，太傅司马宣王潜军东伐","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0519","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-38d197ffbf2f29a2df5f","layer":"pei","quote":"凌、愚谋，以帝幼，制于强臣，不堪为主；楚王彪长而才，欲迎立之，以兴曹氏","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bbdf8c981acf9fda8742","start":12,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0521","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-16101e80dd1e52b3a276","layer":"pei","quote":"黄初中，为和戎护军","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-81528d5bf8ffad6565b9","start":19,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0522","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-16101e80dd1e52b3a276","layer":"pei","quote":"乌丸校尉田豫讨胡有功，小违节度，愚以法绳之","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-81528d5bf8ffad6565b9","start":29,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0523","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-16101e80dd1e52b3a276","layer":"pei","quote":"帝怒，械系愚，免官治罪，诏曰：‘浚何愚！’遂以名之","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-81528d5bf8ffad6565b9","start":51,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0524","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-16101e80dd1e52b3a276","layer":"pei","quote":"正始中，为曹爽长史，后出为兖州刺史","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-81528d5bf8ffad6565b9","start":77,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0525","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-16101e80dd1e52b3a276","layer":"pei","quote":"故愚与王凌阴谋立楚王","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-81528d5bf8ffad6565b9","start":194,"end":204,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0526","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-16101e80dd1e52b3a276","layer":"pei","quote":"乃先使人通意于王，言‘使君谢王，天下事不可知，愿王自爱’！彪亦阴知其意，答言‘谢使君，知厚意也","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-81528d5bf8ffad6565b9","start":205,"end":252,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0537","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-253ca430fef5076b7072","layer":"pei","quote":"正始中，兖州刺史令狐愚与固父伯龙善，辟固，欲以为别驾","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4f91883d6d27c782cd9b","start":25,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0541","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-253ca430fef5076b7072","layer":"pei","quote":"康在京师露其事，太傅乃东取王凌","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4f91883d6d27c782cd9b","start":169,"end":184,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-a147a548bdce7e6382d2","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-daa9e860aaadc2b68b6b","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年，兖州刺史令狐愚与太尉王凌，谋迎彪，都许昌。语在《凌传》。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
